1.2 Aims
By the end of this section you should:

understand what Quarto is and have access to it;
have rendered this template to produce a PDF and HTML version of the notes;
know how to upload and display the rendered HTML and PDF notes on a Moodle page; and
understand what options are available for converting existing notes to this format.

Use sections and subsections to structure your notes;
Use basic Quarto syntax for formatting text and equations;
Use labelling, cross-referencing and citations in Quarto; and
Add figures and images to your notes.
